{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0194_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c9155c75a5892fe901a55580e345348e31b01e171819cf053ab7804c36479a70", "ja": "（今日は撮影で森に来ている。日が落ちると\n不気味だな……まあ、ホラーテイストだから当然か）", "zh": "（今天来森林进行拍摄。太阳下山之后还真是阴森啊……不过，毕竟是恐怖风格，倒也理所当然。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0194_1001_p", "source_sha256": "b19afcb8eb82c87a4eccda1a2b35db4b111db230c52ba1dd72793925410ff7e0", "ja": "ロコ、お疲れさま。\n大丈夫か？　怖かったりしないか？", "zh": "ROCO，辛苦了。\n没事吧？不会害怕吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0194_1002_025roc", "source_sha256": "6707a25e2652fe46cb3bf8c3b08bcdb718a00eb294ab8d14434d76af61ec0736", "ja": "ノ、ノープロブレムです！　ロコは\nこのくらいで怖がったりはしませんよ！", "zh": "没、没问题！ROCO才不会因为这点小事害怕呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0194_1003_p", "source_sha256": "1e4b6593dc95736908844b6594dc490f7c964f859e52ced76ff191be8a9d3241", "ja": "そうか、ならよかったけど。\nしばらく休憩だし、いったんロケバスに戻ろうか。", "zh": "这样啊，那就好。反正要休息一会儿，我们先回外景车吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0194_1004_025roc", "source_sha256": "b2c8b36c1802719ce208d9661e50494a0b1fabbc0bd939743d72b24788c0e4bb", "ja": "アグリーです！　少し寒くなってきましたし。\n……怖くはないですけど！", "zh": "我同意！天气也开始有点冷了。\n……不过，我并不害怕！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0194_1005_025roc", "source_sha256": "9d9aefa3bb59a10cffe4b74622525792ba3fe4ef9398f1cb9398ec2502e940be", "ja": "ふぅ……バスが見えてきましたよ。\nあ、あれ？　ドライバーさんがいない……？", "zh": "呼……已经能看到公交车了。\n啊，咦？司机师傅不在……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0194_1006_p", "source_sha256": "80cfe057fd15bfab98160a717d0e85e52748e98187384e94fc8dbe467b41f91c", "ja": "あれ？　おかしいな。\nまあ、ちょっと外してるんだろう、トイレとか。", "zh": "咦？真奇怪。\n没事，他应该只是暂时离开了，比如去上厕所什么的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0194_1007_025roc", "source_sha256": "26cbd87d608f1e9d3d51902cdb74b0a9e7cfd50f5f5253f810692b64ab011197", "ja": "そ……そうですよね！　オフコースです。\nテリブルな事なんて、あるはずがないです。", "zh": "是……是啊！当然了。\n不可能会发生什么可怕的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0194_1009_025roc", "source_sha256": "143830ea5940d166a604f2311d01afe5cc92bb51fb1459c31f9072b10b5e95e5", "ja": "きゃああああーーーーーっ！？", "zh": "呀啊啊啊啊——！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0194_1010_p", "source_sha256": "8297eb80c56f534229eadf3e3a3c1c4aeaf2cfe0d242d7c4e1f76d94a30ed969", "ja": "えっ、なんだ！？\nロコ！　どうした、大丈夫か！？", "zh": "诶，怎么了！？\nROCO！你怎么了，没事吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0194_1011_025roc", "source_sha256": "aed7413e28462b0041e19a23ff0322708471e6aca91fc9f6c393f1dd01f71c7d", "ja": "い、いました！　車の中に、いました！　誰か！\nすごい……モンスター的な、何かが！！", "zh": "有、有人在！车里有人！\n非常……像怪兽一样的，什么东西！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0194_1012_p", "source_sha256": "ed50c62aed4574c2011390fcc4a13dfd550fb3f251e2271291f9345458f0b499", "ja": "モ、モンスター？\nここからじゃ見えないけど……どんなヤツだ！？", "zh": "怪、怪物？\n从这里看不见……到底是什么家伙！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0194_1013_025roc", "source_sha256": "5531869c7d0d0f31a5b4d46dfad65fddd6faea328f0b4571bb3dee724b0d495c", "ja": "く、詳しくは見てないです！\nちっちゃくて、でも、頭がぶわっと広がってて……！", "zh": "详、详细情况我也没看清！\n个头小小的，可脑袋却蓬地一下膨胀开来……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0194_1014_p", "source_sha256": "e0cf2b8a514d886d402e26e73c1eb111ceba7b02f70435526f7f2692de5f3824", "ja": "……ん？　んん？", "zh": "……嗯？唔？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0194_1015_025roc", "source_sha256": "eb759332e7aa8a91fef87581a9c726a8ce4d0c3640af68520082ef3770b3628a", "ja": "な、なにしてるんですか、{$P$}！\n早く逃げましょう！　一緒に逃げないと！", "zh": "你、你在做什么啊，{$P$}！\n快逃吧！不一起逃的话不行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0194_1016_p", "source_sha256": "18a8f8ee954f77e94cd15b66b2d4dff7ba00742ccc3542b85bb5f960f9475eac", "ja": "いや、待ってくれ。確かロケバスには、大きな姿見が\nなかったか？　入ったところに。", "zh": "不，等等。外景巴士上是不是有一面很大的全身镜来着？就在刚上车的地方。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0194_1017_025roc", "source_sha256": "e2066b79136297111d2c89af5c97f97770d15e45ebe42109df5f6ca96511800e", "ja": "えっ？　はい、ロコもそれを使って\n着替えましたけど…………………………あっ！", "zh": "咦？有啊，ROCO也是用那个换的衣服…………………………啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0194_1018_p", "source_sha256": "01dfbf0b9b426403d7e3c47d2de07ddc85c0a0a0b965e56d5cc1b02ef261ac69", "ja": "うん。", "zh": "嗯。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0194_1019_025roc", "source_sha256": "f1984f11a4fa68a2612ab76e92e5561db9f6950cf0b2a0f0243c6c512ad3cc13", "ja": "ロ、ロコは……ロコは、なんてベーシックな\nミステイクを……か、顔がホットです～！", "zh": "罗、ROCO是……ROCO是，竟然犯了这么基础的错误……脸、脸好烫啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0194_1020_025roc", "source_sha256": "22dcc722cb13acf176f3676ab0b7c3ba560c30e58c14e75cc05be356b5ebb465", "ja": "う、うぅ……{$P$}！　こ、これは\nロコたちだけのシークレットにしましょうっ！", "zh": "呜、呜呜……{$P$}！这、这事就当作\n只有ROCO们的秘密吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0194_1021_025roc", "source_sha256": "0b44711a40d7d6ff49389031c903f914a3e5c60c0e6c5e6138cb9be7a32548c8", "ja": "ふたりだけの、トップシークレットです！\n絶対絶対、約束ですからね！", "zh": "这是只属于我们两个人的最高机密！\n绝对绝对，要约好了哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0194_1022_p", "source_sha256": "b0ceb9fb2a07e49c01c8fb91864ea239c4fcfe8a288fc8da0d81d151bded1444", "ja": "（自分自身さえ、ビックリさせてしまうほどなんだ。\nきっとロコのムービーは、話題になるだろうな！）", "zh": "（甚至连我自己都被吓了一跳。\nROCO的影片一定会引起热议吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
